Hi Alejandro, I'm not sure what is wrong with this function, but it seems off.
To fix your problem, first rename that first column "site".  Then define the maximum number of surveys as an object called R:

R<- 10 # max surveys

Ov<-csvToUMF("Ov-May_Jul 2012.csv",long=F,type="unmarkedFrameOccu")

This should work.

