Hi Diego, you didn't specify any covariates in the model formula.  You can create a single unmarked frame with all covariates included and keep that for all analyses.  When you want to fit different model structures, you need to specify which covariates are associated with which parameters, whether no covariates (~1) or some combination (~covariate1 + covariate2) using different calls to the pcountOpen function.  And you need to read the help file to determine the order of parameters, to ensure the covariate specification is correct.

